          "heading": "Joe Carpenter targets George Furbank Premiership duel for England squad recall",
          "body": "Sale Sharks full-back Joe Carpenter is targeting Sunday’s Premiership clash with Harlequins to outshine George Furbank and force his way back into Steve Borthwick’s plans. The Sale man has not featured for England since earning his sole cap in 2025, but his form has surged following a full pre-season. Only Immanuel Feyi-Waboso has beaten more defenders in the opening rounds of the domestic season, and Carpenter believes back-to-back performances will \"put me in the best position to hopefully get involved come November.\""
