          "kicker": "Club vacancy",
          "heading": "Toulon begin search for new director after Pierre Mignoni's abrupt exit",
          "body": "Toulon are still without a director of rugby following Pierre Mignoni’s sudden resignation earlier this week. Mignoni departed the Top 14 giants after a series of frustrations, reportedly accusing his players of not “behaving like competitors.” While the club’s leadership prioritises a swift appointment to restore order, no definitive successor has emerged in today’s reports. The vacancy remains the primary focus in the French domestic landscape as the national side prepares for the upcoming November internationals."
