          "kicker": "Scrum scrutiny",
          "heading": "Eddie O’Sullivan warns Andy Farrell after Leinster’s international front-row scrum struggles",
          "body": "Former head coach Eddie O’Sullivan has flagged South Africa’s \"frightening\" scrum dominance as a major concern for Andy Farrell ahead of the autumn internationals. Following Leinster’s recent 26-20 defeat to the Sharks, where a Test-strength front-row including Andrew Porter and Ronan Kelleher conceded eight scrum penalties, O’Sullivan suggested the Springboks’ physical power is becoming a problem for World Rugby. While acknowledging the challenge is not unique to Ireland, he noted that South Africa \"take you to the woodshed\" through sheer physical attrition."
