          "heading": "Italy face South Africa in Turin following previous home defeat",
          "body": "Italy lost 32-14 to South Africa in the most recent meeting between the sides at home in November 2025. The Azzurri currently sit 11th in the Nations Championship log after three rounds of play. Gonzalo Quesada’s squad returns to home soil for the first time in the competition for this Round 4 fixture following a 57-10 defeat against Australia in Round 3. Italy have yet to record a victory in the tournament and currently carry a points difference of -94."
