          "kicker": "LEGAL DISPUTE",
          "heading": "Scottish Rugby faces continued legal uncertainty over stalled concussion lawsuit",
          "body": "The legal challenge regarding brain injuries in rugby union remains in a state of uncertainty as claimants navigate a multi-million-pound financial hurdle. Although former players won a significant court battle in August to prevent World Rugby and Scottish Rugby from having the case thrown out, the litigation is currently hindered by a £2.8 million bill for legal costs. This impasse must be resolved before the group, which includes several former internationals, can proceed with their pursuit of damages for neurological conditions."
