          "kicker": "REGIONAL CULL",
          "heading": "Welsh Rugby Union publishes report justifying the 2028 West Wales professional cull",
          "body": "The Welsh Rugby Union has released the 68-page Keystone report detailing the evidence used to decide that only one professional team will represent West Wales from 2028. With Cardiff and the Dragons already granted capital and east licences, the Ospreys and Scarlets must now compete for the remaining slot. Union bosses maintain that funding cannot support four professional sides beyond the 2027-28 season. A final decision on which of the two historic west-Wales clubs will be culled is expected in June 2027."
