          "body": "Argentina head coach Felipe Contepomi has bolstered his support staff ahead of the Nations Championship resumption by recruiting Shaun Edwards and Mario Ledesma. Edwards, the renowned defence guru who helped France to three Six Nations titles, joins through to the 2027 World Cup. He is joined by former Pumas head coach Ledesma, who returns as forwards coach after four years away. Contepomi noted the pair bring “enormous international experience” to the squad before next month’s test against Ireland in Dublin."
