          "kicker": "Centenary milestone",
          "heading": "Japan Rugby Football Union hosts online forum to discuss future values",
          "body": "The Japan Rugby Football Union held an online forum this week to mark its centenary, shifting focus toward the long-term societal impact of the game. Rather than focusing on match results, the event explored how the sport’s core values—the spirit of 'No Side', respect for diversity, and 'One Team'—can be integrated into wider social development. Top executives and stakeholders reviewed the union's history while discussing the evolving role of rugby within the modern era."
        },
